{"chapter": "constructions", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "01LL", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$A'' \\to A$", "MATH_0002": "$A'' \\to A'$", "MATH_0003": "$A' \\to A$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{A}$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:f405314df17609896ad44a2dd34ed6023c23079f06b494701996e84cd0654833", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:4787d37292079291f8d8910c043f8c61951fe78fb8f6af7d11e6737a05501b6b", "source_text": "This follows as the map <MATH_0001> is the composition of <MATH_0002> and\n<MATH_0003> (because <MATH_0004> is a sheaf).\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:f260fb8b221d5c2c24daa66d83eaa86cfd66cd830bf1353170ea9e487b741b79", "unit_id": "tag:01LO:proof"}
{"chapter": "constructions", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "01LL", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$$\n\\pi : \\underline{\\Spec}_S(\\mathcal{A}) \\longrightarrow S\n$$", "MATH_0002": "$U \\subset S$", "MATH_0003": "$i_U : \\pi^{-1}(U) \\to \\Spec(\\mathcal{A}(U))$", "MATH_0004": "$U$", "MATH_0005": "$U \\subset U' \\subset S$", "MATH_0006": "$$\n\\xymatrix{\n\\Spec(\\mathcal{A}(U)) \\ar[r]^{i_U^{-1}} &\n\\pi^{-1}(U) \\ar[rr]^{inclusion} & &\n\\pi^{-1}(U') \\ar[r]^{i_{U'}} &\n\\Spec(\\mathcal{A}(U'))\n}\n$$", "MATH_0007": "$\\underline{\\Spec}_S(\\mathcal{A})$", "MATH_0008": "$S$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{situation-relative-spec}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{lemma-spec-inclusion}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\item", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\end{enumerate}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-glue-relative-spec}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:c80f01104f0d6936a3d7c5a1301e89b202fcb343ebff8d9622c1b71f9693d9ea", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:8387b46a870e649f603c3c2a0f42b955ca0a0eae502627b9f580fe10e18d99c1", "source_text": "In Situation <REF_0001>.\nThere exists a morphism of schemes\n<MATH_0001>\nwith the following properties:\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> for every affine open <MATH_0002> there exists an isomorphism\n<MATH_0003> over <MATH_0004>, and\n<STRUCT_0003> for <MATH_0005> affine open the composition\n<MATH_0006>\nis the open immersion of Lemma <REF_0002> above.\n<STRUCT_0004>\nMoreover, <MATH_0007>\nis unique up to unique isomorphism over <MATH_0008>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:b6e33d90af2e954949324b16ba367aadfcf763873bc006243e92f8ea74c3abad", "unit_id": "tag:01LP:statement"}
{"chapter": "constructions", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "01LL", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-relative-glueing}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{lemma-spec-inclusion}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{lemma-transitive-spec}", "REF_0004": "\\ref{lemma-relative-glueing}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:1ec0e550a1e7f95221ceeaf5181617f15a56a2bf42c3a7511213ce339d9f74a2", "source_text": "Follows immediately from\nLemmas <REF_0001>,\n<REF_0002>, and\n<REF_0003>.\nUniqueness is stated in the last sentence of\nLemma <REF_0004>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:19aba541aa8835ceee4776e0ebdef0d5ed3d9e23d8e27184a9a07cef87694a5e", "unit_id": "tag:01LP:proof"}
